lts under any circumstances or external pressures from any party.`,confidentialityTitle:`Confidentiality and Privacy`,confidentialityText:`I commit to maintaining the absolute confidentiality of all test materials, applicant data, and results. I will not share or copy any program-related information without an official directive from the Program Management.`,conflictsTitle:`Integrity and Conflict of Interest`,conflictsText:`I commit to immediate recusal from conducting or participating in any assessment if I have a direct or indirect personal or professional relationship with any applicant. I also commit to notifying Program Management immediately to assign another assessor. Furthermore, I commit not to communicate with fellow assessors in any way that might influence their evaluation of any party related to me.`,noBriberyTitle:`No Bribery`,noBriberyText:`I fully understand that accepting a bribe, regardless of its size or type, is a breach of trust and a criminal act under all legislations. Therefore, I commit not to solicit or accept any money, gifts, or favors from any party related to the applicant, whether intended to influence results, assist the applicant, or even establish a friendship within or around the assessment premises.`,profRulesTitle:`Professional Rules`,profRulesText:`I acknowledge that I have reviewed and fully understand the importance of adhering to professional rules. I understand that any breach or attempted breach of these rules will lead to the suspension of my account, loss of my certification, and I will not be exempt from legal accountability.`,identityTitle:`Identity Verification Commitment`,identityText:`I commit to verifying the identity of every applicant by examining their official ID before starting the test. I will not allow any individual to take the test on behalf of another. I accept full responsibility for any costs or losses incurred by any beneficiary regarding recruitment if it is proven that the ID was not verified or that I facilitated an impersonation.`,accuracyTitle:`Accuracy of Reporting`,accuracyText:`I commit to recording test results accurately and honestly based solely on my observations during the assessment. I will not submit any false or speculative information.`,safeTitle:`Safe and Professional Environment`,safeText:`I commit to adhering to all safety rules during the assessment. I also commit to treating all applicants with respect and refraining from any form of harassment, racism, or discrimination based on gender or race, or any behavior classified as racist or unprofessional.`,complianceTitle:`Operational Compliance`,complianceText:`I commit to full compliance in conducting all assessments in accordance with the approved SVP operational standards and established testing protocols. I also pledge to adhere to all directives, circulars, and controls issued by the Program Management governing the testing process, and I acknowledge that any deviation from these standards constitutes a breach of my professional duties.`,assessmentTitle:`Assessment Integrity`,assessmentText:`I commit to ensuring that every applicant personally and directly performs all required tasks in both theoretical and practical examinations. I pledge strict adherence to not allowing the bypassing, skipping, or cancellation of any part of the prescribed assessment process, nor providing any unauthorized assistance that could compromise the fairness and integrity of the result.`,monitoringTitle:`Monitoring and Reporting`,monitoringText:`I commit to ensuring effective supervision and monitoring of the test session throughout its entire duration. I also pledge to immediately report, through approved official channels, any suspected cases of cheating, irregular behavior, or any violation of the rules governing the examination. I acknowledge my legal and administrative liability for any negligence in reporting such infractions.`,confirmAcknowledgment:`I confirm that I have read this acknowledgment and fully understood its content, and that in addition to being an acknowledgment, it represents in its content professional rules that I am committed to follow, maintain, and apply the highest standards of honesty and integrity throughout my work in the program, and that any violation of any of the provisions of this policy will expose me to legal accountability and bear any consequences arising from this breach and exclude me from the task at the absolute discretion of the program management.`},sessions:{reject:`Reject`,approve:`Approve`,withdrawal:`Withdrawal`,sessionNo:`Session No.`,sessionDate:`Session Date`,sessionDateAndTime:`Session Date and Time`,sessionDuration:`Session Duration`,sessionStatus:`Session Status`,basicInfo:`Basic Information`,applicants:`Applicants`,withdrawBtnInfoTitle:`Sorry, withdrawing is not allowed within {time} hours of the test date. Thank you for your understanding.`,applications:{applicantName:`Applicant Name`,passportNo:`Passport No.`,bookingNo:`Booking No.`,testResult:`Test Result`,bookingStatus:`Booking Status`,attachment:`Attachment`,noApplicant:`Currently, there aren’t any applicants.`,startTestCBT:`Start test (CBT)`,startPractical:`Start practical test`,uploadFile:`Upload file`,downloadFile:`Download file`,submitBtnText:`Submit`,backBtnText:`Back`,uploadFileInputLabel:`The practical test form for the applicant along with photos of the applicant`,uploadFileInputTipText:`File number limit: 1. Single file size limit: 5 megabytes. Allowed file types: pdf.`,fileUploadSuccessMsg:`Applicant’s file has been submitted successfully!`,fileSizeExceededMsg:`The number of files should not exceed one, and each file should not exceed 5 megabytes in size. File must be in pdf format.`,fileSizeExceededMsg2Mb:`The number of files should not exceed one, and each file should not exceed 2 megabytes in size. File must be in pdf format.`},cancelationDetails:`Cancelation details`,canceledBy:`Canceled by`,cancelationReason:`Cancelation reason`,filter:{filter:`Filter`,sessionStatus:`Session Status`,allStatuses:`All statuses`,selectAll:`Select all`,clearAll:`Clear all`,apply:`Apply`,drafted:`Drafted`,initiallyScheduled:`Initially Scheduled`,scheduled:`Scheduled`,assessorWithdrawn:`Assessor Withdrawn`,inProgress:`In progress`,canceled:`Canceled`,completed:`Completed`,expired:`Expired`}},unAssignedSessions:{unassignedExamSessions:`Unassigned sessions`,startDateAndTime:`Start Date and Time`,backToTable:`Back to Unassigned session page`,occupation:`Occupation`,noSessions:`Currently, there aren't any sessions.`},assignedSessions:{assignedSessions:`Assigned sessions`,assignedExamSessions:`Assigned exam sessions`,practicalResult:`Practical result`,dateAndTime:`Date and Time`,backToTable:`Back to Assigned session page`,noAssignedSessions:`Currently, there aren’t any assigned sessions for you.`},assessorBasicInfo:{numberOfReservations:`Number of reservations`,session:`Session`,category:`Category`,city:`City`,testCenter:`Test Center`,dateAndTime:`Date and Time`,duration:`Durations`,fullCapacity:`Number of Seats`,sessionStatus:`Session status`,map:`Map`,assignedAssessor:`Assigned assessor`},register:{chooseEducation:`Choose education`,educationalQulifications:`What is your educational qualification?`,professioanlQualification:`Do you have professional qualification?`,internationalQualification:`Do you have an international qualification?`,uploadQualifications:`Upload Qualifications`,uploadFormat:`The file size should not exceed 3 megabytes. <br/> The allowed file formats are <strong>jpg, png, jpeg, pdf </strong> <br/> The allowed number of files is only <strong>3</strong>`,unlearnedOption:`Unlearned (Can not read or write)`,learnedOption:`Learned (Can read and write)`,primaryOption:`Primary (6 - 8 years)`,middleOption:`Middle (10 - 12 years)`,secondaryOption:`Secondary (12 years and more)`,diplomaOption:`Diploma`,bachelorsOption:`Bachelors degree or more`,noneOption:`None`,trainingOption:`Short course / Training`,degreeOption:`Degree`,requiredField:`This field is required`,fileUploadError:`The number of files should not exceed 3, with each file not exceeding 3 megabytes in size, and they should be in one of the following formats: jpg, png, jpeg, pdf.`,internationalQualifyDiploma:`Diploma`},assessor:`Assessor`}},ar:{assessor:{duration:`المدة`,status:`الحالة`,view:`عرض`,testCenter:`مركز الاختبار`,category:`المهنة`,city:`المدينة`,actions:`الإجراءات`,occupation:`المهنة`,integrityAcknowledgement:`إقرار نزاهة المُقيّم`,integrityModal:{objectivityTitle:`العدالة والحياد`,objectivityText:`أتعهد بأن أكون عادلاً مع الجميع، ولن أسمح لعلاقاتي أو مشاعري الشخصية بالتأثير على نتائج الاختبار تحت أي ظرف أو تأثير من أي طرف.`,confidentialityTitle:`السرية والخصوصية`,confidentialityText:`أتعهد بالحفاظ على سرية جميع أوراق الاختبار وبيانات المتقدمين والنتائج، ولن أقوم بمشاركة أو نسخ أي معلومات خاصة بالبرنامج دون توجيه رسمي من إدارة البرنامج.`,conflictsTitle:`النزاهة (تضارب المصالح)`,conflictsText:`أتعهد بالتنحي فوراً وعدم إجراء أي تقييم أو المشاركة فيه إذا كانت لدي علاقة شخصية أو مهنية مباشرة أو غير مباشرة مع أي متقدم، كما أتعهد بإبلاغ إدارة البرنامج فوراً ليتم تعيين مقيم آخر. كما أتعهد بهذا الصدد بعدم التواصل مع  زملائي من المقيمين لكل ما من شأنه التأثير على نتيجة تقييمهم لأي طرف تربطني به أي علاقة.`,noBriberyTitle:`منع الرشوة`,noBriberyText:`أتفهم بشدة أن قبول الرشوة مهما كان حجمها أو نوعها يعد خيانة للأمانة وفعل مجرم في كل التشريعات وعليه أتعهد بعدم طلب أو قبول أي أموال أو هدايا أو خدمات مهما كان حجمها من أي طرف له علاقة بالمتقدم للاختبار سواء كان الغرض منها التأثير على نتيجة الاختبار أو مساعدة المتقدم أو حتى لعقد صداقة أثناء أو في محيط مقر الاختبارات والتقييم.`,profRulesTitle:`القواعد المهنية`,profRulesText:`أتعهد وأقر بأني مطلع ومدرك تماماً أهمية اتباع القواعد المهنية وعدم مخالفتها وأنه في حال خالفت هذه القواعد أو حاولت المخالفة، سيتم إيقاف حسابي، وسأفقد شهادتي، وأني لن أعفى من المسائلة القانونية.`,identityTitle:`الالتزام بالتحقق من الهوية`,identityText:`أتعهد بالتحقق من هوية كل متقدم من خلال فحص هويته الرسمية قبل ب